{"id": "000VJS", "title": "Half Hearted", "posted": "Heute, 12:59 Uhr", "author": "ChinStrap", "rules": "Just a fan of being able to use modifiers to disambiguate lines that usually need something else. Thanks to all testers and I hope you enjoy!\n\nPlay Now! \u2192\n\nRules\n\nNormal Sudoku\u2022 Normal sudoku rules apply.\n\nHalver Cells\u2022 Place nine halver cells in the grid, one in each row, column and box.\n\u2022 Each digit 1-9 appears exactly once in halver cells.\n\u2022 A halver cell's value is half the digit. A non-halver cell's value is its digit.\n\nBetween Lines\u2022 VALUES on a line must be strictly between the VALUES in the circles on either end of the line.", "solutionCode": "Box 5, left to right (9 digits)", "difficulty": 3, "solvedCount": 9, "tags": ["Sudoku"], "links": [{"url": "https://sudokupad.app/lr5sauewyh?setting-nogrid=true", "kind": "sudokupad"}], "firstSeen": "2026-10-17T17:00:00+00:00", "data": "", "link": "https://sudokupad.app/lr5sauewyh?setting-nogrid=true", "linkKind": "sudokupad", "settings": {"nogrid": "true"}, "summary": {"format": "scl", "decoded": true, "rows": 10, "cols": 9, "cages": 0, "hasSolution": true, "features": ["lines"]}}